## First test

A reported mobilised or aggregate position cannot become a project disbursement.
The fixture retains both forms without summing them.

## Actions and exit criteria

Retrieve every frozen Viet Nam census item with raw-byte/hash provenance;
extract candidates deterministically; review dispositions and admit only
supported canonical facts. Preserve unnamed slots, source currency, lifecycle
state, reporting/event dates and unknowns. Complete only when every census item
has a documented disposition and a clean replay reproduces the candidate set.

